          %p
            Regarding that we the distributions are not the maps from the underlying space we need to replace pre-composition
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi X
                  %mo →
                  %mover
                    %mi X
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ˜
