                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    \\mathcal{D}_\rho(\mathbb{R}^n)
                    \\hookrightarrow
                    \\mathcal{D}(\mathbb{R}^n)
                    \\coloneqq
                    C^\infty_{cp}(\mathbb{R}^n)
            %p
              for the subspace of that of all
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bump+functions"} bump functions
              on those that vanish to order
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ρ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \rho
              at the origin.
            %p
              By definition this is equivalently the joint
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/kernel"} kernel
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/partial+derivative"} partial
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derivatives+of+distributions"} derivatives of distributions
              of order
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
